  "name": null,
  "problem": "$$\n\\begin{aligned}u\\overset{A-I\\,}{\\to }v\\overset{A-I\\,}{\\to }w\\overset{A-I\\,}{\\to }0 \\\\ x\\overset{A+4I\\,}{\\to }y\\overset{A+4I\\,}{\\to }z\\overset{A+4I\\,}{\\to }0\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nGiven the action of the matrices $A-I$ and $A+4I$ on the nonzero vectors $u,v,w,x,$ $y$ and $z$ as depicted above, which of the following statements are true?\n\nI. $w$ is a generalized eigenvector of rank $2$ corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =1$ of $A$\n\nII. $u$ is a generalized eigenvector of rank $3$ corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =1$ of $A$\n\nIII. $y$ is a generalized eigenvector of rank $2$ corresponding to the eigenvalue $\\lambda =-4$ of $A$",
